option.FOXY_PBR_PARALLAX.comment=Adds pronounced surface relief to compatible materials at a higher performance cost.
option.FOXY_MATERIAL_REFLECTIONS.comment=Adds reflections to smooth and metallic PBR materials.
option.FOXY_MATERIAL_REFLECTION_HIGH_QUALITY.comment=Improves reflection stability at a significantly higher performance cost.
option.FOXY_MATERIAL_REFLECTION_GLOBAL.comment=Enables voxel-space offscreen reflection fallback. Requires VRTGI.
option.FOXY_MATERIAL_REFLECTION_OFFSCREEN.comment=Adds resource-pack material sampling to offscreen voxel reflections; voxel reflections remain available when disabled. Requires Global Material Reflections and VRTGI.
option.FOXY_MATERIAL_REFLECTION_SMOOTH_STEPS.comment=Controls offscreen voxel reflection trace steps for smooth materials and glass; lowering it directly reduces this path's workload.
option.FOXY_TONEMAPPER.comment=Selects the color and contrast style used for the final image.
option.FOXY_CAS.comment=Sharpens the final image with a small performance cost.
option.FOXY_DOF.comment=Blurs areas outside the camera focus distance.
option.FOXY_DOF_AUTO_FOCUS.comment=Automatically focuses on the center of the screen.
option.centerDepthHalflife.comment=Center-depth half-life. Higher values simulate a slower lens pull.
option.FOXY_DOF_QUALITY.comment=Higher quality improves blur smoothness at a higher performance cost.
option.FOXY_CLOUD_MULTISCATTERING=Cloud Multiple Scattering
option.FOXY_CLOUD_MULTISCATTERING.comment=Improves light diffusion inside clouds. Higher quality has a greater performance cost.
